Package: fprint-control-center
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6
Recommends: fprintd, polkit-1
Description: High-performance PyQt6 control center daemon for fprintd fingerprint devices
 A background system tray daemon and GUI control center for fprintd
 fingerprint devices on Linux laptops with touchpad fingerprint scanners.
 Supports 360-degree multi-angle enrollment, KeePassXC/PAM integration,
 interactive verification testing, and USB autosuspend power tuning.
